  "prefLabel": "Plc 907.02 Expired Licenses",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 907.02 Expired Licenses.\n\n(a) If an application for renewal is received after the expiration date of the license, the license shall be expired.\n\n(b) A massage therapist whose license has expired shall not practice massage therapy in New Hampshire unless:\n\n(1) The license is reinstated in accordance with Plc 312, if within one year of expiration; or\n\n(2) A new license is applied for and received, if the expired license has lapsed.\n\nSource. #14387, eff 10-17-25, EXPIRES: 10-17-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc900.html"
}
